+## Phase 5: User Story 3 - Withdraw a snippet before it expires (Priority: P2)
+
+**Goal**: The holder of a snippet's delete token can withdraw it; nobody else can, and a failed
+attempt reveals nothing a read would not have revealed.
+
+**Independent Test**: Publish, `DELETE /pastes/<id>` with `X-Delete-Token: <token>`, confirm `204`
+with an empty body and that the snippet then `404`s; publish another, attempt deletion with no
+header and with a wrong token, confirm `403` both times and that the snippet is still readable;
+`DELETE` an id never issued with any token or none, confirm `404` rather than `403`; `DELETE` an
+already-deleted id with its original token, confirm `404`.
+
